                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Lundi balaaya be siseecha babao mu sibala esio. Nio babaandu ba Yuda bakhola bibiindu bie khusinyisia lukali bioosi bibiakholwangwa ne chikolo nicho Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi aoona khukhwama mu sibala, Baisiraeli ne bengilamo.",
          "type": "text",
